    <p class="lsv2-lede">Most safety questions about Lio come from people who've read about vape toxicology. Those concerns apply to a different category of device.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="lsv2-compare-grid">

    <div class="lsv2-compare-col is-vape lsv2-reveal">
      <div class="lsv2-compare-col-head"><span class="marker"></span> A vape</div>
      <h3>Aerosolizes a heated liquid</h3>

      <div class="lsv2-compare-diagram" aria-hidden="true">
